      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is actually a really important hud element to consider, especially as we may be moving more towards individual hand gesturing with the ability to map even more gestures than before.\nBeing able to know when a gesture is triggering, because sometimes it's hard to tell if the gesture is activating correctly (this is something that index controller users may find with finger tracking), is important to know, and helps you to control and convey that immersion between avatar interaction much better.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
