  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I think a tiny hud element that would show you the name of the gesture you're using would be cool.\n\nMaybe toggleable.\n\nThat way, if you have facial expressions mapped to gestures, you'd know what face you're making, which can be difficult with the Vive's controls if you can't see your hands or don't have hand gestures.",
